2023-11-13T21:15:00","session_id":"session_29","session_index":29,"source_sha256":"54467269af9126a5aa1c69719e65ba491bf309d917b57c60c46f1bcf20cd8936","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":17},{"dia_id":"D29:18","global_turn_index":544,"locator":"[S29T18]","raw_turn_sha256":"f29bf09d6d5aad598e1c28518b3110838887dc1bfe27d1f8c560ccc696bb953a","rendered_turn_sha256":"af5c92a4c29817e9fd0db74e71a55fcab03e76c397aab7d4ee10eca14cba17c7","session_date":"2023-11-13","session_datetime":"2023-11-13T21:15:00","session_id":"session_29","session_index":29,"source_sha256":"e5312fcc0dc5a8b507d70f55ad6c53e66d5ffe3e01208499fb7e767deb022252","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-11-02, follow-up to the notebook photo he shared at the chat's close (see the 2023-11-02 entry in ## Relationships): when Calvin asked whether the notebook helps him stay connected to the creative process (\"Does this notebook help you stay connected to the creative process?\"), Dave: \"Yes, Calvin, writing lyrics and notes - that's awesome! It will boost my motivation! Writing lyrics boosts my motivation to grow!\" — he writes lyrics and notes in it, and writing lyrics boosts his motivation to grow; he also shared a photo of a Pink Floyd headphone sitting on a shelf [S28T33][S28T34].\n- On 2023-11-02, when Calvin asked whether these really help him stay focused when making music, Dave: music really helps him focus and be productive [S28T35][S28T36]. He listens to vinyl to relax and stay on track when he's doing his car stuff — music keeps him focused and \"makes it feel great\" [S28T36][S28T38]. He has a record player — a bit old but \"still gets the job done\" — and shared a photo of it (a record player sitting on the floor next to a couch) [S28T38].\n- As of 2023-11-02, when Calvin asked what tunes he's listening to these days, Dave: \"Lately, I've been getting into classic rock. The music from that era is timeless.\" (consistent with his favorite band, Aerosmith — see above) [S28T39][S28T40]. Closing of that exchange: Calvin: \"Cool, Dave! Classic rock has had a huge effect on music. Keep discovering!\"; Dave: \"Thanks, Calvin! Classic rock has had a huge impact on music. Always fun to dig in and find new tunes.\" [S28T41][S28T42].\n- On 2023-11-13, asked Calvin whether he finds having supportive people around him important for his artist development (\"Do you also find having supportive people around you important for your artist development?\"); Calvin: yes — they are key for him to grow as an artist, motivating him to get better and stay true to himself, and vital in the tough music industry (Calvin's side in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md) [S29T6][S29T7]. Then, shown Calvin's photo of a group of people sitting around a desk, Dave asked \"Is this a pic of some musicians you're collaborating with?\" — unanswered in this excerpt [S29T7][S29T8].\n- On 2023-11-13, reacted to Calvin's news that he's been supporting young musicians from a music program: \"Wow, Calvin, that's amazing! You're really making a difference by supporting the next generation of musicians. It's great to nurture their passion and help them thrive.\"; then, after Calvin said it's \"like a torch being passed to keep music alive\" and that he'll support the ambitious young musicians for a long time, Dave: \"Your support for them keeps the music going and passes on the legacy. That's so awesome!\" (Calvin's side in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md) [S29T9][S29T10][S29T11][S29T12]. Shown Calvin's photo of himself making a beat for a young artist, Dave: \"Wow, that's cool! Your music studio looks great. Have you tried out any new ideas lately?\" and, hearing Calvin is having fun trying out new sounds and pushing the boundaries (\"always gotta stay ahead in this\"), said \"Awesome, Calvin! Experimenting and pushing boundaries is key to making our art grow. Can't wait to see where these new ideas take you!\" (Calvin's details in the Recording studio section of /memories/calvin.md); Calvin: \"Yeah, it's exciting to see where these new ideas lead. It's all about growing and evolving!\" and signed off, \"Have a good one. I need to go now. Take care, Dave!\"; the chat closed with Dave: \"For sure, Calvin! Growing and evolving is key for any artist. Don't stop pushing yourself and keep exploring. Can't wait to see what you come up with next! See ya Cal! Take care!\" [S29T13][S29T14][S29T15][S29T16][S29T17][S29T18].","text_sha256":"4cc17bb331f60b75aa699f2d653aed7cae9fdcee35cf268296b4ee009c97689d","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D9:18"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":134,"line_start":134,"source_locators":["[S9T18]"],"text_sha256":"7867512f3af07c729953bbadf6dd81bcb4fa1931f440d5805cc54cb2b47b16f8"},{"dia_ids":["D9:20"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":135,"line_start":135,"source_locators":["[S9T20]"],"text_sha256":"6c31985aea891311a629e0a59918d47ecb8bcc80a5852dc137ff0c3831cd263c"},{"dia_ids":["D9:19"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":136,"line_start":136,"source_locators":["[S9T19]"],"text_sha256":"0ef36cfe18f7a45e422b213aea857026ed00976537c8b26c6d31fe00113ccee7"},{"dia_ids":["D19:1","D19:3"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":137,"line_start":137,"source_locators":["[S19T1]","[S19T3]"],"text_sha256":"b92baac3cace8ec475d44d7c01aabb0a6d893fecb6933eaed7b594b7828ea456"},{"dia_ids":["D28:22","D28:23","D28:24"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":138,"line_start":138,"source_locators":["[S28T22]","[S28T23]","[S28T24]"],"text_sha256":"48d71678e8ef7522ebb9408e78c3f6c39712fe9d71be32983cdfaf89e53b5c6b"}],"dia_ids":["D9:18","D9:20","D9:19","D19:1","D19:3","D28:22","D28:23","D28:24"],"evidence_id":"ev-16251279a506d4730d3a58b8c48190b94021f84b51ad0bfc0b2fdf88434569f3","group_id":"/memories/dave.md > # Dave","line_end":138,"line_star